{"id":"ca9dcc9ec1866c06","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-generalized-quantifier-normal-form.md","title":"广义量词的单调用范式","display":"df-generalized-quantifier-normal-form — 广义量词的单调用范式","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-generalized-quantifier-normal-form","aliases":["29-df-generalized-quantifier-normal-form"],"display":"df-generalized-quantifier-normal-form — 广义量词的单调用范式","depends_on":["[[29-df-fo-turing-reduction]]","[[29-df-fo-query]]"],"source_locator":"Equation11.22 and normal-form properties, p.178, DjVu scan193","source_basis":"扫描193原图已对照；用指定解释族统一fo/fop/qfp范式"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-generalized-quantifier-normal-form"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-generalized-quantifier-normal-form</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-generalized-quantifier-normal-form — 广义量词的单调用范式"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"08afaae97db1d476\" href=\"?note=08afaae97db1d476\" title=\"29-df-fo-turing-reduction\">29-df-fo-turing-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"75340800e8905793\" href=\"?note=75340800e8905793\" title=\"29-df-fo-query\">29-df-fo-query</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Equation11.22 and normal-form properties, p.178, DjVu scan193"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"扫描193原图已对照；用指定解释族统一fo/fop/qfp范式"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak D,\\mathcal V,\\mathfrak B_{\\mathfrak D}\">\\(\\mathfrak D,\\mathcal V,\\mathfrak B_{\\mathfrak D}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal G_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}\">\\(\\mathcal G_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}\\)</span> 见所列依赖；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf s=(\\tau,S)\\in\\mathfrak B_{\\mathfrak D}\">\\(\\mathbf s=(\\tau,S)\\in\\mathfrak B_{\\mathfrak D}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 是指定解释族的标识；对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span> 给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathscr I_r[\\sigma,\\tau]\\subseteq\\bigcup_{k\\geq1}\\mathrm{FOQuery}_k[\\sigma,\\tau;\\mathcal D_\\sigma]\">\\(\\mathscr I_r[\\sigma,\\tau]\\subseteq\\bigcup_{k\\geq1}\\mathrm{FOQuery}_k[\\sigma,\\tau;\\mathcal D_\\sigma]\\)</span>，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 都满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I[\\mathcal D_\\sigma]\\subseteq\\mathcal D_\\tau\">\\(I[\\mathcal D_\\sigma]\\subseteq\\mathcal D_\\tau\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r=\\mathrm{fo}\">\\(r=\\mathrm{fo}\\)</span> 时取全部上述合法FO解释；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r=\\mathrm{fop},\\mathrm{qfp}\">\\(r=\\mathrm{fop},\\mathrm{qfp}\\)</span> 时必须先选固定数值背景与合法域，再取满足对应投影条件的解释子族。这里不假定任意数值解释自动符合投影条件。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N_{r,\\mathfrak D}(\\mathbf s)\\coloneqq\\{(\\sigma,I^{-1}[S])\\mid\\sigma\\in\\mathcal V,\\ I\\in\\mathscr I_r[\\sigma,\\tau]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal N_{r,\\mathfrak D}(\\mathbf s)\\coloneqq\\{(\\sigma,I^{-1}[S])\\mid\\sigma\\in\\mathcal V,\\ I\\in\\mathscr I_r[\\sigma,\\tau]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NF}_{r,\\mathfrak D}(\\mathbf s)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathcal G_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}\\subseteq\\mathcal N_{r,\\mathfrak D}(\\mathbf s).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{NF}_{r,\\mathfrak D}(\\mathbf s)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathcal G_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}\\subseteq\\mathcal N_{r,\\mathfrak D}(\\mathbf s).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf a=(\\sigma,A)\\preccurlyeq_{r,\\mathfrak D}\\mathbf s=(\\tau,S)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists I\\in\\mathscr I_r[\\sigma,\\tau]\\;A=I^{-1}[S].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf a=(\\sigma,A)\\preccurlyeq_{r,\\mathfrak D}\\mathbf s=(\\tau,S)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists I\\in\\mathscr I_r[\\sigma,\\tau]\\;A=I^{-1}[S].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>范式性质说每个含任意嵌套调用的可定义查询，都能写成一次 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_S(I)\">\\(Q_S(I)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 的公式不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_S\">\\(Q_S\\)</span>。把这种性质写成模型类等价，避免误要求语法树逐字等于单调用节点。fo/fop/qfp分别约束 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 的允许类型；合法性、数值背景与目标域不能在命题中省去。投影定义可查 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9e37f96b88bff2af\" href=\"?note=9e37f96b88bff2af\" title=\"29-df-first-order-projection\">29-df-first-order-projection</a> 和 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b5e158c134df5c1d\" href=\"?note=b5e158c134df5c1d\" title=\"29-df-quantifier-free-projection\">29-df-quantifier-free-projection</a>，此处只有选用该特例时才使用它们。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-fo-turing-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"08afaae97db1d476","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-fo-turing-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-fo-query","status":"resolved","id":"75340800e8905793","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-fo-query]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-first-order-projection","status":"resolved","id":"9e37f96b88bff2af","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"范式性质说每个含任意嵌套调用的可定义查询，都能写成一次 $Q_S(I)$，其中 $I$ 的公式不含 $Q_S$。把这种性质写成模型类等价，避免误要求语法树逐字等于单调用节点。fo/fop/qfp分别约束 $I$ 的允许类型；合法性、数值背景与目标域不能在命题中省去。投影定义可查 [[29-df-first-order-projection]] 和 [[29-df-quantifier-free-projection]]，此处只有选用该特例时才使用它们。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-quantifier-free-projection","status":"resolved","id":"b5e158c134df5c1d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"范式性质说每个含任意嵌套调用的可定义查询，都能写成一次 $Q_S(I)$，其中 $I$ 的公式不含 $Q_S$。把这种性质写成模型类等价，避免误要求语法树逐字等于单调用节点。fo/fop/qfp分别约束 $I$ 的允许类型；合法性、数值背景与目标域不能在命题中省去。投影定义可查 [[29-df-first-order-projection]] 和 [[29-df-quantifier-free-projection]]，此处只有选用该特例时才使用它们。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak D,\\mathcal V,\\mathfrak B_{\\mathfrak D}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal G_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf s=(\\tau,S)\\in\\mathfrak B_{\\mathfrak D}","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathscr I_r[\\sigma,\\tau]\\subseteq\\bigcup_{k\\geq1}\\mathrm{FOQuery}_k[\\sigma,\\tau;\\mathcal D_\\sigma]","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"I[\\mathcal D_\\sigma]\\subseteq\\mathcal D_\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"r=\\mathrm{fo}","display":false},{"tex":"r=\\mathrm{fop},\\mathrm{qfp}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal N_{r,\\mathfrak D}(\\mathbf s)\\coloneqq\\{(\\sigma,I^{-1}[S])\\mid\\sigma\\in\\mathcal V,\\ I\\in\\mathscr I_r[\\sigma,\\tau]\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NF}_{r,\\mathfrak D}(\\mathbf s)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathcal G_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D}\\subseteq\\mathcal N_{r,\\mathfrak D}(\\mathbf s).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf a=(\\sigma,A)\\preccurlyeq_{r,\\mathfrak D}\\mathbf s=(\\tau,S)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists I\\in\\mathscr I_r[\\sigma,\\tau]\\;A=I^{-1}[S].","display":true},{"tex":"Q_S(I)","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"Q_S","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false}],"bytes":2198,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-163","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-generalized-quantifier]]、[[29-df-fo-turing-reduction]]、[[29-df-generalized-quantifier-normal-form]]、[[29-thm-generalized-quantifier-completeness]] — 合法解释、嵌套调用、范式与完全性"},{"id":"3a9398f013444350","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathscr I_r,\\preccurlyeq_{r,\\mathfrak D},\\operatorname{NF}_{r,\\mathfrak D}$ 沿用 [[29-df-generalized-quantifier-normal-form]]；每个解释是合法FO查询。对每个词汇，存在 $J_\\sigma\\in\\mathscr I_r[\\sigma,\\sigma]$ 满足 $\\forall M\\in\\mathcal D_\\sigma\\;(J_\\sigma(M)\\cong M)$。这里允许元组域上的同构恒等解释，不要求集合意义的恒等函数本身属于FOQuery。"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-78","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-generalized-quantifier-normal-form]]"}],"outgoing":["08afaae97db1d476","75340800e8905793","9e37f96b88bff2af","b5e158c134df5c1d"]}